{"seq":1,"slug":"protocol-overview","title":"LSP 协议概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/lsp-client/protocol-overview","wordCount":972,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"lsp-协议概览\">LSP 协议概览</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LSP 用一套标准协议把「编辑器」与「语言智能」解耦，让同一语言服务器服务多个编辑器：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>JSON-RPC 2.0 传输层</strong>：无状态的远程调用协议，通过 stdio / socket 双向通信，消息分为请求、响应与通知。</li>\n<li><strong>三类消息</strong>：请求（带 id，需应答）、通知（无 id，不等应答）、响应（对应某请求 id）。</li>\n<li><strong>初始化握手</strong>：客户端与服务端在 <code>initialize</code> 阶段交换能力，确定后续可用的功能集。</li>\n<li><strong>能力协商</strong>：双方各自声明支持的能力（completion、hover、diagnostics…），交集决定实际启用的功能。</li>\n<li><strong>服务器生命周期</strong>：从 initialize 到 shutdown / exit，客户端负责启动、监控与优雅终止服务器进程。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"json-rpc-2-0-传输层\">JSON-RPC 2.0 传输层</h2><p>语言服务器协议（LSP）构建在 JSON-RPC 2.0 之上，这是一种无状态的轻量级远程调用协议。编辑器（客户端）与语言服务器通过 stdio、socket 或管道进行双向通信，每条消息由 HTTP 风格的头部和 JSON 主体组成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface JsonRpcMessage {&#10;  jsonrpc: &#39;2.0&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface RequestMessage extends JsonRpcMessage {&#10;  id: number | string;&#10;  method: string;&#10;  params?: unknown[] | object;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ResponseMessage extends JsonRpcMessage {&#10;  id: number | string | null;&#10;  result?: unknown;&#10;  error?: ResponseError;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface NotificationMessage extends JsonRpcMessage {&#10;  method: string;&#10;  params?: unknown[] | object;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ResponseError {&#10;  code: number;&#10;  message: string;&#10;  data?: unknown;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JsonRpcMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jsonrpc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequestMessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JsonRpcMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResponseMessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JsonRpcMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResponseError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationMessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JsonRpcMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResponseError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>传输帧格式示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Content-Length: 73\\r\\n&#10;\\r\\n&#10;{&quot;jsonrpc&quot;:&quot;2.0&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:1,&quot;method&quot;:&quot;initialize&quot;,&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;capabilities&quot;:{}}}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Length: 73\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"initialize\",\"params\":{\"capabilities\":{}}}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传输方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>stdio</td>\n<td>本地进程通信</td>\n<td>最常用，VS Code 默认方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP Socket</td>\n<td>远程语言服务器</td>\n<td>支持网络访问，需处理重连</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Named Pipe</td>\n<td>Windows 本地</td>\n<td>Windows 专有，高性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSocket</td>\n<td>浏览器环境</td>\n<td>Monaco Editor 在线版常用方式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> JSON-RPC 消息中没有 <code>method</code> 字段的是响应消息，有 <code>id</code> 的是请求消息，既无 <code>id</code> 也无 <code>result</code> 的是通知消息。区分这三种类型是理解 LSP 的关键。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"lsp-消息类型\">LSP 消息类型</h2><p>LSP 定义了三种核心消息类型，它们在通信模型中扮演不同角色。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 编辑器(客户端)&#10;    participant S as 语言服务器&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 请求 (Request) - initialize&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: 响应 (Response) - capabilities&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 通知 (Notification) - initialized&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 通知 - textDocument/didOpen&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: 通知 - textDocument/publishDiagnostics&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 请求 - textDocument/completion&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: 响应 - CompletionList\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 编辑器(客户端)\n    participant S as 语言服务器\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 请求 (Request) - initialize\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 响应 (Response) - capabilities\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 通知 (Notification) - initialized\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 通知 - textDocument/didOpen\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: 通知 - textDocument/publishDiagnostics\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 请求 - textDocument/completion\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 响应 - CompletionList</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消息类型</th>\n<th>是否有 id</th>\n<th>是否需要响应</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>典型示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Request</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>initialize, textDocument/hover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Response</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>回复方</td>\n<td>initialize result</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Notification</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>initialized, didOpen, didChange</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type MessageHandler = {&#10;  onRequest(method: string, handler: (params: unknown) =&gt; Promise&lt;unknown&gt;): void;&#10;  onNotification(method: string, handler: (params: unknown) =&gt; void): void;&#10;  sendRequest&lt;T&gt;(method: string, params: unknown): Promise&lt;T&gt;;&#10;  sendNotification(method: string, params: unknown): void;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessageHandler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onNotification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sendRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sendNotification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"初始化握手流程\">初始化握手流程</h2><p>LSP 连接建立后的第一件事是执行初始化握手。这是一个严格的三步流程：客户端发送 <code>initialize</code> 请求，服务端返回能力声明，客户端发送 <code>initialized</code> 通知确认。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 编辑器&#10;    participant S as 语言服务器&#10;&#10;    Note over C: 启动语言服务器进程&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialize(clientCapabilities)&#10;    Note over S: 解析客户端能力&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: InitializeResult(serverCapabilities)&#10;    Note over C: 解析服务端能力&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialized({})&#10;    Note over C,S: 正常通信开始&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 编辑器\n    participant S as 语言服务器\n\n    Note over C: 启动语言服务器进程\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialize(clientCapabilities)\n    Note over S: 解析客户端能力\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: InitializeResult(serverCapabilities)\n    Note over C: 解析服务端能力\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialized({})\n    Note over C,S: 正常通信开始\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InitializeParams {&#10;  processId: number | null;&#10;  rootUri: string | null;&#10;  capabilities: ClientCapabilities;&#10;  initializationOptions?: unknown;&#10;  workspaceFolders?: WorkspaceFolder[] | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface InitializeResult {&#10;  capabilities: ServerCapabilities;&#10;  serverInfo?: {&#10;    name: string;&#10;    version?: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dar